// 2.0.5d RSQ GRENADE'S GRENADE FIRED FROM AN UNDER-BARREL LAUNCHER (zscript/rsr/rsr_m203.zs RSM_Nades).
// The launcher's own round, Brutal Doom 22's ShortGrenade, with only its burst changed: where Brutal Doom's 40 mm
// explosion went off, RSQ Grenade's grenade of the round's kind goes off (RSM_KindBurst, given to itself, does it at
// once, at the round). Its flight, trail, sprite and direct hit are ShortGrenade's own (inherited). Every label that
// leads to ShortGrenade's explosion is here: an inherited "Goto Explode" would still go to ShortGrenade's own.
// Fired by the Rifle (Rifle.dec FireGrenade, FireGrenade2) and the Machinegun (Machinegun.dec RSM_Fire) in place of
// ShortGrenade while an RSQ Grenade grenade is loaded (RSM_KindLoaded); it takes the kind on its first think
// (RSK_M203Handler.WorldThingSpawned). With no kind it bursts as the plain round's damage (UGBLExplosion).

ACTOR RSM_KindRound : ShortGrenade
{
	States
	{
	Death:
	XDeath:
		TNT1 A 1
		Goto Explode

	Explode:
	Death.Slime:
	Death.Fire:
	Death.Bullet:
	Death.Shotgun:
	Death.SSG:
	Death.Cutless:
	Death.Shrapnel:
		TNT1 A 0 A_ChangeFlag("SHOOTABLE", 0)
		TNT1 A 0 A_GiveInventory("RSM_KindBurst", 1)
		TNT1 A 2
		Stop
	}
}
